<title>USA: Casino Magic extends exchange offer.</title>
<headline>Casino Magic extends exchange offer.</headline>
<dateline>BAY SAINT LOUIS, Miss. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Magic of Louisiana Corp said Tuesday it has extended the expiration date of its pending exchange offer for its 13 percent Series B First Mortgage Notes Due 2003 with contingent interest for all outstanding 13 percent Series A First Mortgage Notes Due 2003 with contingent interest.</p>
<p>The offer has been extended until 1700 EDT on August 21 from 1700 EDT on August 19.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
